{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-53e7ddad6b21f9aab490","title":"时苗建安入相府出寿春令谒蒋济醉不见刻木射之","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-53e7ddad6b21f9aab490","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"时苗建安入相府出寿春令谒蒋济醉不见刻木射之","evidence":["hechang-q-e44a6a09974aee70a55d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hechang-p-5b7d784bafd9a4","role":"任官谒见刻木","evidence":["hechang-q-e44a6a09974aee70a55d"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"醉未见","evidence":["hechang-q-e44a6a09974aee70a55d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-e44a6a09974aee70a55d"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-e44a6a09974aee70a55d","order":4723}],"persons":[{"id":"hechang-p-5b7d784bafd9a4","name":"时苗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0009","name":"蒋济","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-e44a6a09974aee70a55d","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7d4d74db241caee025e6","layer":"pei","quote":"建安中，入丞相府。出为寿春令，令行风靡。扬州治在其县，时蒋济为治中。苗以初至，往谒济；济素嗜酒，适会其醉，不能见苗。苗恚恨还，刻木为人，署曰‘酒徒蒋济’，置之墙下，旦夕射之。州郡虽知其所为不恪，然以其履行过人，无若之何。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-49639b91fe1a19fa430b","start":21,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
